Description: quote includes of the bundled engine's own headers
 <Catalog.h> and <UTF8.h> exist both in the bundled xpdf-derived
 sources and in the packaged headers (locale catalog, UTF-8 mapping),
 and the packaged -I directories outrank the bundled include path for
 angle includes, so the wrong header is picked. Use quoted includes so
 the compiler's own-directory and -iquote search finds the bundled
 headers the code calls into.
Author: Numerio <b.vitruvio@gmail.com>
Forwarded: no
Origin: https://github.com/HaikuArchives/BePDF

diff --git a/bepdf/beos/AnnotAppearance.h b/bepdf/beos/AnnotAppearance.h
index 68af7a0..c659c57 100644
--- a/bepdf/beos/AnnotAppearance.h
+++ b/bepdf/beos/AnnotAppearance.h
@@ -26,7 +26,7 @@
 // xpdf
 #include <Object.h>
 #include <XRef.h>
-#include <Catalog.h>
+#include "Catalog.h"
 #include <PDFDoc.h>
 
 #include "Annotation.h"
